NAME
     id - who you are, as numbers

SYNOPSIS
     id [-u] [-g] [-n] [USER]

DESCRIPTION
     id prints the user and group ids of USER, or of whoever is asking,
     with the supplementary groups.

OPTIONS
     -u   only the user id
     -g   only the group id
     -n   names rather than numbers

SEE ALSO
     whoami(1), groups(1), who(1)
